        "detailed_description": "<h1>Custom DLC</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DLC content will be available for purchase with a description of the content. Do you have an idea for this game that you would like to see? Contact me.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sign Off is a first person shooter where signs chase you. Each MOB has a loot tree and drops items and ammo with variable probability. Vending machines offer structures that can be placed to defend your location but turns off the generator when overpowered. Unlock achievements for experience rewards or level up by shooting signs. They may not look like much but they sneak up on you. </p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sign Off is a first person shooter where signs chase you. Each MOB has a loot tree and drops items and ammo with variable probability. Vending machines offer structures that can be placed to defend your location but turns off the generator when overpowered. Unlock achievements for experience rewards or level up by shooting signs. They may not look like much but they sneak up on you. </p>",
